1
00:00:32,365 --> 00:00:39,372
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:01:12,906 --> 00:01:13,823
<font color="white">Grandfather.</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:01:17,410 --> 00:01:18,244
<font color="white">Why?</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:01:19,871 --> 00:01:21,623
<font color="white">Why do you hate me so much?</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:01:22,248 --> 00:01:24,209
<font color="white">Because you have no talent.</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:01:24,292 --> 00:01:26,211
<font color="white">It's time to give up.</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:01:27,087 --> 00:01:29,380
<font color="white">You'll never make it.</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:01:29,964 --> 00:01:30,799
<font color="white">Grandfather…</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:33,843 --> 00:01:37,222
<font color="white">But I love music too.</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:01:40,725 --> 00:01:43,853
<font color="white">I love it so much.</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:01:45,104 --> 00:01:46,022
<font color="white">So why do you say…</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:01:48,399 --> 00:01:49,734
<font color="white">I'll never make it?</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:01:58,368 --> 00:01:59,494
<font color="white"><i>Why not me?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:02:01,830 --> 00:02:03,081
<font color="white"><i>Why?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:06,584 --> 00:02:10,547
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:16,052 --> 00:02:17,095
{\an8}<font color="white">Why not me…</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:17,178 --> 00:02:18,888
{\an8}<font color="white">EPISODE 5</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:19,973 --> 00:02:20,890
{\an8}<font color="white">Why?</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:02:21,808 --> 00:02:22,892
{\an8}<font color="white">-Why?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

20
00:02:25,812 --> 00:02:27,021
{\an8}<font color="white">Pi-o, what's wrong?</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:28,439 --> 00:02:29,732
{\an8}<font color="white">Did you have another nightmare?</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:02:30,275 --> 00:02:31,234
{\an8}<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:02:32,902 --> 00:02:33,903
{\an8}<font color="white">Tell me.</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:02:35,071 --> 00:02:37,866
{\an8}<font color="white">What nightmare wakes you up</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">every 30 minutes?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

25
00:02:40,827 --> 00:02:41,995
{\an8}<font color="white">Don't worry about it.</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:02:55,675 --> 00:02:59,762
<font color="white">CHOI JEONG-YO</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:17,405 --> 00:03:19,157
<font color="white">Why do you keep calling?</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,450
<font color="white"><i>I'm sorry.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:20,533 --> 00:03:21,784
<font color="white">I'm really sorry,</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:23,036 --> 00:03:26,748
<font color="white">but I'm outside the hospital</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and would like to check in on Pi-o.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

31
00:03:27,457 --> 00:03:29,083
<font color="white">How many times do I have to tell you?</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:29,876 --> 00:03:31,753
<font color="white">Pi-o doesn't want to see you.</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:32,503 --> 00:03:33,421
<font color="white"><i>Don't you get it?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:33,504 --> 00:03:34,505
<font color="white">But I…</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:48,102 --> 00:03:49,437
<font color="white">Why are you up?</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:51,314 --> 00:03:52,190
<font color="white">Get some more sleep.</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:58,279 --> 00:03:59,322
<font color="white">Was it Jeong-yo?</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:02,325 --> 00:04:03,159
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:03,243 --> 00:04:04,786
<font color="white">Please call Jeong-yo for me.</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:06,537 --> 00:04:07,497
<font color="white">I need to talk to him.</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:08,373 --> 00:04:09,958
<font color="white">About what?</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:10,041 --> 00:04:11,501
<font color="white">Just wait until you're discharged.</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:11,584 --> 00:04:12,710
<font color="white">I said call him.</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:14,379 --> 00:04:15,213
<font color="white">Call Jeong-yo.</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:23,721 --> 00:04:24,722
<font color="white">KANG PI-O (MALE, 16 YEARS OLD)</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:29,644 --> 00:04:30,478
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:40,154 --> 00:04:41,489
<font color="white">Are you feeling better now?</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:42,448 --> 00:04:43,283
<font color="white">Yeah.</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:44,367 --> 00:04:45,243
<font color="white">Hey.</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:45,910 --> 00:04:48,955
<font color="white">Hospitalized for pneumonia?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">What are you, a little kid?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

51
00:04:49,038 --> 00:04:52,709
<font color="white">This is why I've been telling you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to eat and sleep well.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

52
00:04:58,881 --> 00:05:00,008
<font color="white">When are you getting discharged?</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:05:00,967 --> 00:05:02,093
<font color="white">-Soon.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Soon?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

54
00:05:05,263 --> 00:05:07,140
<font color="white">Don't stay too long, okay?</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:05:07,223 --> 00:05:10,393
<font color="white">I'm bored out of my mind</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">because you're not around.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

56
00:05:11,227 --> 00:05:13,771
<font color="white">Han-rim and Seok-hwan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">are so full of themselves these days.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

57
00:05:13,855 --> 00:05:15,565
<font color="white">They've been acting up,</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:15,648 --> 00:05:17,358
<font color="white">and it's driving me crazy.</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:18,526 --> 00:05:19,652
<font color="white">Jeez.</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:24,949 --> 00:05:26,617
<font color="white">I wanted to tell you something.</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:26,701 --> 00:05:27,827
<font color="white">You did?</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:29,412 --> 00:05:32,415
<font color="white">Go ahead. Tell me whatever it is.</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:38,921
<font color="white">After I get discharged…</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:41,174 --> 00:05:42,925
<font color="white">I'm going to prepare</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for the Harmonie Competition.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

65
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:44,844
<font color="white">The competition?</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:05:44,927 --> 00:05:47,346
<font color="white">I thought you didn't want to</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">enter competitions anymore.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

67
00:05:48,723 --> 00:05:50,808
<font color="white">How else can I prove myself if I don't?</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:05:51,392 --> 00:05:52,769
<font color="white">But still,</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:05:53,728 --> 00:05:55,772
<font color="white">I thought you wanted to</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">be happy making music.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

70
00:05:56,314 --> 00:05:59,192
<font color="white">You said you were</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tired of competing, so why?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

71
00:05:59,275 --> 00:06:00,193
<font color="white">I'm not a genius.</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:06:01,652 --> 00:06:04,572
<font color="white">If I don't prove myself on stage,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who will listen to me play?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

73
00:06:06,824 --> 00:06:08,367
<font color="white">The reason I called you here</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:06:09,702 --> 00:06:10,995
<font color="white">is to ask you…</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:06:12,747 --> 00:06:14,207
<font color="white">to enter the same competition.</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:14,749 --> 00:06:15,583
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:16,167 --> 00:06:17,376
<font color="white">Don't say no.</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:18,795 --> 00:06:20,546
<font color="white">If I'm really your friend,</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:06:21,881 --> 00:06:23,633
<font color="white">you'll do me this favor.</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:06:24,675 --> 00:06:26,803
<font color="white">-But that's just--</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Why?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

81
00:06:27,887 --> 00:06:29,972
<font color="white">Do you think you're guaranteed to win?</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:06:30,890 --> 00:06:33,935
<font color="white">You're wrong.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Things won't go your way this time.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

83
00:06:34,727 --> 00:06:35,645
<font color="white">I already told you.</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:06:36,854 --> 00:06:39,440
<font color="white">I'll do whatever it takes to prove myself.</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:06:40,399 --> 00:06:42,068
<font color="white">But don't you dare lose on purpose.</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:06:43,319 --> 00:06:45,154
<font color="white">If I catch wind of that…</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:06:47,573 --> 00:06:49,075
<font color="white">I'm going to kill you.</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:06:53,913 --> 00:06:54,789
<font color="white">Fine.</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:06:58,334 --> 00:07:01,254
<font color="white">But you'd better practice really hard,</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:07:01,337 --> 00:07:03,422
<font color="white">or I'll wipe the floor with you.</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:05,383 --> 00:07:07,009
<font color="white">By the way, you can't kill me.</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:17,979 --> 00:07:19,063
<font color="white"><i>You made the right call.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:07:20,481 --> 00:07:22,191
<font color="white">Like you said, placing in competitions</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:23,317 --> 00:07:25,403
<font color="white">is the only way to play professionally.</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:25,486 --> 00:07:27,655
<font color="white">-Let's prepare well and--</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Don't get excited.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

96
00:07:28,739 --> 00:07:30,199
<font color="white">If I don't win the competition…</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:07:33,744 --> 00:07:35,121
<font color="white">I'm going to quit the piano.</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,540
<font color="white">I'd rather quit…</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:07:40,418 --> 00:07:41,461
<font color="white">than be a mediocre pianist.</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:07:46,966 --> 00:07:48,092
<font color="white"><i>Do you want to</i></font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:07:48,759 --> 00:07:50,178
<font color="white">enter the competition?</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:07:52,805 --> 00:07:53,639
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:07:54,223 --> 00:07:55,308
<font color="white">Then why are you doing it?</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:07:56,434 --> 00:07:57,685
<font color="white">I have to enter…</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:08:00,771 --> 00:08:03,441
<font color="white">to help Pi-o get back on his feet.</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:08:07,653 --> 00:08:09,906
<font color="white">If he needs me to light a fire under him,</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:08:11,532 --> 00:08:13,409
<font color="white">I'll gladly do it.</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:08:16,662 --> 00:08:17,538
<font color="white">All right.</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:08:18,873 --> 00:08:20,291
<font color="white">Let's do it.</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:08:20,374 --> 00:08:21,209
<font color="white">Okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:08:21,292 --> 00:08:23,586
<font color="white">But I need you to promise me something.</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:08:24,212 --> 00:08:26,130
<font color="white">If you're just going to</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">play a supporting role,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

113
00:08:27,465 --> 00:08:28,466
<font color="white">stop right now.</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:08:30,051 --> 00:08:31,844
<font color="white">I care for you and Pi-o</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:08:32,553 --> 00:08:34,555
<font color="white">equally as my students.</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:08:37,725 --> 00:08:39,936
<font color="white">If I catch you not giving it your all,</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:08:41,521 --> 00:08:43,523
<font color="white">I won't let it slide.</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:08:48,903 --> 00:08:50,488
<font color="white">Why is he wearing headphones during lunch?</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:08:50,571 --> 00:08:51,739
<font color="white">Seriously.</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:09:48,337 --> 00:09:49,755
<font color="white">Congratulations.</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:31,005
<font color="white">Good afternoon, contestants.</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:10:31,088 --> 00:10:34,091
<font color="white">Congratulations on advancing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to the main round</font><font color="white"></font></font>

123
00:10:34,175 --> 00:10:37,261
<font color="white">of the Prague Harmonie</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">International Competition.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

124
00:10:40,181 --> 00:10:43,643
<font color="white">First, allow me to outline</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the competition schedule.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

125
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:47,438
<font color="white">This week, 24 contestants</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:10:47,521 --> 00:10:51,525
<font color="white">will be selected from</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">approximately 60 main round participants</font><font color="white"></font></font>

127
00:10:52,026 --> 00:10:54,153
<font color="white">to advance to the semifinals.</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:10:54,236 --> 00:10:58,532
<font color="white">Those 24 semifinalists</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">will be competing next week.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

129
00:10:59,367 --> 00:11:02,370
<font color="white">From there, 12 finalists will be chosen,</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:11:02,453 --> 00:11:05,539
<font color="white">and they will move</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from their homestays to the chapel</font><font color="white"></font></font>

131
00:11:06,457 --> 00:11:09,168
<font color="white">where all mobile phones</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and electronic devices</font><font color="white"></font></font>

132
00:11:09,251 --> 00:11:10,753
<font color="white">will be confiscated.</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:11:11,629 --> 00:11:14,298
<font color="white">And they will reside together</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for one week.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

134
00:11:14,382 --> 00:11:17,843
{\an8}<font color="white">SEMIFINALS</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">QUALIFYING ROUND FOR THE TOP 24</font><font color="white"></font></font>

135
00:11:18,552 --> 00:11:20,805
<font color="white">Contestant number 15,</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:11:20,888 --> 00:11:24,016
<font color="white">Jeong-yo Choi, please come to the stage.</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:12:15,734 --> 00:12:17,069
<font color="white">You've got to be kidding me.</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:12:18,028 --> 00:12:19,071
<font color="white">Where'd this guy come from?</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:12:19,155 --> 00:12:22,241
<font color="white">I have no idea, but damn it,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he's ridiculously good.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

140
00:12:51,896 --> 00:12:52,855
<font color="white">Fine.</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:12:53,439 --> 00:12:54,648
<font color="white">His technique, yeah.</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:12:55,566 --> 00:12:58,194
<font color="white">Genuinely… untouchable.</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:12:59,487 --> 00:13:00,988
<font color="white">No one even comes close to that.</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:13:24,011 --> 00:13:25,638
<font color="white">What's wrong with your pinky finger?</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:13:30,518 --> 00:13:32,561
<font color="white">If you keep playing, you'll destroy it.</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:13:33,521 --> 00:13:35,606
<font color="white">Give practice a rest</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and get it treated first.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

147
00:13:37,191 --> 00:13:39,318
<font color="white">I don't know what you saw,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but stop being dramatic.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

148
00:13:39,401 --> 00:13:41,320
<font color="white">Mind your own business</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and worry about yourself.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

149
00:14:01,423 --> 00:14:02,466
<font color="white">You're okay, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:14:03,551 --> 00:14:04,760
<font color="white">Are you taking</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:14:05,636 --> 00:14:06,929
<font color="white">your medication?</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:14:08,055 --> 00:14:08,889
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:14:09,473 --> 00:14:10,432
<font color="white">Good.</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:14:11,350 --> 00:14:13,561
<font color="white">Hang in there for three more weeks.</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:17,648
<font color="white">I'll get stronger meds from the hospital,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so just bear with it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

156
00:14:17,731 --> 00:14:19,149
<font color="white">We've worked too hard to get here.</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:21,277
<font color="white">It'd be such a shame</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:14:22,528 --> 00:14:25,197
<font color="white">to give up now after all this, right?</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:15:25,841 --> 00:15:26,884
<font color="white">Where have you been?</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:15:29,470 --> 00:15:31,013
<font color="white">Why aren't you in bed?</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:15:32,514 --> 00:15:33,807
<font color="white">Have you been practicing until now?</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:36,685
<font color="white">What if you wear yourself out?</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:15:37,269 --> 00:15:39,897
<font color="white">Is it unusual to practice until 4 a.m.?</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:15:40,481 --> 00:15:44,234
<font color="white">Or is it unusual to be out</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">until this hour?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

165
00:15:46,070 --> 00:15:49,281
<font color="white">I went for a drive because I'm jet-lagged.</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:15:49,365 --> 00:15:50,658
<font color="white">Go to bed.</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:15:50,741 --> 00:15:53,994
<font color="white">It'll only get tougher starting tomorrow,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so you need to pace yourself.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

