<font color="white">Do I look like a pushover to you?</font><font color="white"></font>

498
00:48:00,627 --> 00:48:02,879
<font color="white">I said you'd get paid after the job.</font><font color="white"></font>

499
00:48:02,963 --> 00:48:04,381
<font color="white">What's with all the whining?</font><font color="white"></font>

500
00:49:30,092 --> 00:49:31,760
<font color="white">Where are we going now?</font><font color="white"></font>

501
00:49:33,220 --> 00:49:37,516
<font color="white">Isn't this the opposite direction</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from the concert hall?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

502
00:49:39,017 --> 00:49:40,185
<font color="white">Excuse me.</font><font color="white"></font>

503
00:49:40,268 --> 00:49:41,520
<font color="white">Stop, stop!</font><font color="white"></font>

504
00:49:41,603 --> 00:49:43,397
<font color="white">I want to go to the toilet!</font><font color="white"></font>

505
00:49:44,856 --> 00:49:45,899
<font color="white">Are you listening to me?</font><font color="white"></font>

506
00:49:45,982 --> 00:49:48,026
<font color="white">I said I need to go to the restroom!</font><font color="white"></font>

507
00:49:49,361 --> 00:49:50,195
<font color="white">Cut the crap!</font><font color="white"></font>

508
00:49:50,779 --> 00:49:52,948
<font color="white">Or else I'll put a bullet</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">through your head.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

509
00:50:27,649 --> 00:50:30,610
<font color="white">Watch it before you drive us into a grave.</font><font color="white"></font>

510
00:50:30,694 --> 00:50:31,611
<font color="white">No, you watch it.</font><font color="white"></font>

511
00:50:31,695 --> 00:50:33,488
<font color="white">Don't get blood splatter in the car.</font><font color="white"></font>

512
00:50:34,781 --> 00:50:38,660
<font color="white">Who do you think you are?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Don't tell me what to do.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

513
00:50:38,744 --> 00:50:40,203
<font color="white">You want me to kill you first?</font><font color="white"></font>

514
00:50:40,287 --> 00:50:42,581
<font color="white">Just focus on driving, you piece of crap!</font><font color="white"></font>

515
00:53:02,053 --> 00:53:03,722
<font color="white">Bravo!</font><font color="white"></font>

516
00:53:54,606 --> 00:53:55,774
<font color="white">Where did he disappear to?</font><font color="white"></font>

517
00:53:55,857 --> 00:53:58,276
<font color="white">I don't know.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">We can't get in touch with security.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

518
00:54:01,947 --> 00:54:02,906
<font color="white">Excuse me.</font><font color="white"></font>

519
00:54:02,989 --> 00:54:04,407
<font color="white">Is something going on?</font><font color="white"></font>

520
00:54:04,908 --> 00:54:05,909
<font color="white">We're not sure yet,</font><font color="white"></font>

521
00:54:05,992 --> 00:54:07,953
<font color="white">but the last finalist</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">still hasn't arrived.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

522
00:54:13,833 --> 00:54:18,088
<font color="white">We regret to inform you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of some unfortunate news.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

523
00:54:18,797 --> 00:54:21,091
<font color="white">The final contestant of the competition,</font><font color="white"></font>

524
00:54:21,174 --> 00:54:24,636
<font color="white">Jeong-yo Choi, has gone missing.</font><font color="white"></font>

525
00:54:25,512 --> 00:54:29,683
<font color="white">Therefore, today's final performance</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">has been canceled.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

526
00:54:30,558 --> 00:54:33,353
<font color="white">The decision regarding the award ceremony</font><font color="white"></font>

527
00:54:33,436 --> 00:54:37,816
<font color="white">will be decided as soon as the situation</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">has been assessed.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

528
00:54:38,733 --> 00:54:39,567
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

529
00:54:46,658 --> 00:54:48,159
<font color="white">What do you mean Jeong-yo is missing?</font><font color="white"></font>

530
00:54:48,243 --> 00:54:50,370
<font color="white">We don't know anything yet.</font><font color="white"></font>

531
00:54:50,453 --> 00:54:52,831
<font color="white">We reported the situation to the police.</font><font color="white"></font>

532
00:54:52,914 --> 00:54:55,166
<font color="white">But for the time being,</font><font color="white"></font>

533
00:54:55,250 --> 00:54:57,085
<font color="white">please return to your accommodations</font><font color="white"></font>

534
00:54:57,168 --> 00:54:59,963
<font color="white">and then we'll contact you individually.</font><font color="white"></font>

535
00:55:23,695 --> 00:55:25,864
<font color="white">-Where have you been?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-You scared me!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

536
00:55:45,884 --> 00:55:48,470
<font color="white">Why won't you even tell us</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">what you've found so far?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

537
00:55:49,137 --> 00:55:50,346
<font color="white">Was he kidnapped?</font><font color="white"></font>

538
00:55:50,430 --> 00:55:51,681
<font color="white">Was it an accident?</font><font color="white"></font>

539
00:55:51,765 --> 00:55:54,184
<font color="white">Have you identified the driver</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and the guard yet?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

540
00:55:54,267 --> 00:55:55,101
<font color="white">Okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

541
00:55:55,185 --> 00:55:57,270
<font color="white">There's nothing we can share at this time.</font><font color="white"></font>

542
00:55:57,353 --> 00:56:01,066
<font color="white">What do you mean you can't tell me?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I'm his guardian!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

543
00:56:01,149 --> 00:56:01,983
<font color="white">Stop, Hyun-jeong.</font><font color="white"></font>

544
00:56:02,067 --> 00:56:04,194
<font color="white">These people don't know anything yet.</font><font color="white"></font>

545
00:56:04,277 --> 00:56:06,988
<font color="white">How could something like this happen?</font><font color="white"></font>

546
00:56:07,655 --> 00:56:08,823
<font color="white">What's going on?</font><font color="white"></font>

547
00:56:09,407 --> 00:56:11,326
<font color="white">Is it true Jeong-yo has gone missing?</font><font color="white"></font>

548
00:56:12,202 --> 00:56:13,620
<font color="white"><i>Police are currently investigating</i></font><font color="white"></font>

549
00:56:13,703 --> 00:56:16,247
<font color="white"><i>whether this disappearance is related</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to the recent kidnapping attacks</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

550
00:56:16,331 --> 00:56:17,332
<font color="white"><i>carried out by</i>…</font><font color="white"></font>

551
00:56:27,050 --> 00:56:28,176
<font color="white">Where's Jeong-yo?</font><font color="white"></font>

552
00:56:28,802 --> 00:56:30,011
<font color="white">They haven't found him yet.</font><font color="white"></font>

553
00:56:31,971 --> 00:56:34,766
<font color="white">They haven't even located the car</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he was in.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

554
00:56:34,849 --> 00:56:35,934
<font color="white">We'll have to wait longer</font><font color="white"></font>

555
00:56:37,310 --> 00:56:38,853
<font color="white">for the police investigation.</font><font color="white"></font>

556
00:56:44,776 --> 00:56:46,528
<font color="white">Pi-o, are you okay?</font><font color="white"></font>

557
00:56:50,698 --> 00:56:52,158
<font color="white">Don't worry too much.</font><font color="white"></font>

558
00:56:54,285 --> 00:56:55,537
<font color="white">He'll be okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

559
00:56:56,204 --> 00:56:57,997
<font color="white">They'll find him soon.</font><font color="white"></font>

560
00:56:59,541 --> 00:57:01,000
<font color="white">I'm sure there was just a mix-up.</font><font color="white"></font>

561
00:57:02,460 --> 00:57:06,131
<font color="white">So don't worry too much.</font><font color="white"></font>

562
00:57:08,800 --> 00:57:09,634
<font color="white">Mom.</font><font color="white"></font>

563
00:57:10,844 --> 00:57:11,761
<font color="white">Mom.</font><font color="white"></font>

564
00:57:12,971 --> 00:57:14,139
<font color="white">Mom, did you…</font><font color="white"></font>

565
00:57:48,715 --> 00:57:53,511
<font color="white">The winner of the Prague Harmonie</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">International Competition is</font><font color="white"></font></font>

566
00:57:53,595 --> 00:57:55,930
<font color="white">Mr. Pi-o Kang.</font><font color="white"></font>

567
00:58:50,735 --> 00:58:55,448
{\an8}<font color="white">2026</font><font color="white"></font>

568
00:58:59,369 --> 00:59:01,579
<font color="white">You look tired from the long trip.</font><font color="white"></font>

569
00:59:01,663 --> 00:59:02,747
<font color="white">I'm fine.</font><font color="white"></font>

570
00:59:02,830 --> 00:59:04,666
<font color="white">Did you secure the practice room?</font><font color="white"></font>

571
00:59:05,416 --> 00:59:06,918
<font color="white">It was too late to find one,</font><font color="white"></font>

572
00:59:07,001 --> 00:59:09,879
<font color="white">so we arranged a bar</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">across from the hotel.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

573
00:59:09,963 --> 00:59:12,048
<font color="white">So you can use it after it closes.</font><font color="white"></font>

574
00:59:12,882 --> 00:59:14,092
<font color="white">Will that be all right?</font><font color="white"></font>

575
00:59:14,676 --> 00:59:15,969
<font color="white">That should be okay for now.</font><font color="white"></font>

576
01:00:42,555 --> 01:00:44,474
<font color="white">I'VE MEMORIZED EVERYTHING.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">TAKE IT IF YOU NEED IT!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

577
01:01:04,577 --> 01:01:06,704
<font color="white">FOUR HANDS, TWO SONATAS</font><font color="white"></font>

578
01:01:06,788 --> 01:01:09,040
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>About that Choi Jeong-yo rumor…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

579
01:01:09,123 --> 01:01:10,958
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>People say you were behind it.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

580
01:01:11,042 --> 01:01:13,086
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>It's because of you.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

581
01:01:13,169 --> 01:01:16,589
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I found someone in Romania</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>who said they saw Mr. Choi.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

582
01:01:16,673 --> 01:01:17,799
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>It was this man.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

583
01:01:17,882 --> 01:01:19,509
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I'd like to ask him myself.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

584
01:01:19,592 --> 01:01:21,844
{\an8}<font color="white">What did you do to Jeong-yo?</font><font color="white"></font>

585
01:01:22,345 --> 01:01:23,513
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>What's in it for me?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

586
01:01:24,597 --> 01:01:25,431
{\an8}<font color="white">Tell me now!</font><font color="white"></font>

587
01:01:26,015 --> 01:01:27,183
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Do you even know how special he was?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

588
01:01:27,684 --> 01:01:29,310
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>What exactly are you trying to confirm?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

589
01:01:30,103 --> 01:01:31,688
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Proof that Mr. Choi is alive?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

590
01:01:32,355 --> 01:01:33,606
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Or proof of his death?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

591
01:01:35,233 --> 01:01:40,238
{\an8}<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Jenny Kim</font><font color="white"></font>
